All morning...

10
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,080
Even looking at you takes an angle.

11
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,120
Mr. Duan, behave yourself.

12
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,520
The more I hold back,
the more I want you.

13
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:29,620
♪Your gaze, your breath,
they trap my soul♪

14
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:34,060
♪No escape, no place to hide,
no control♪

15
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:37,020
♪I break all rules for your♪

16
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,720
(Zhan Xiang.)

17
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,400
(Have you seen Duan Xiuming?)

18
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,640
(He's not picking up.)

19
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,600
(Neither is he in his office.)

20
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,760
(I'll look for him.)

21
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,080
Keep going.

22
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,400
Stop it.

23
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,800
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

24
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,560
Scared?

25
00:01:55,660 --> 00:02:00,260
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

26
