♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

30
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:20,860
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

31
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,400
Am I scared?

32
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:31,180
♪Can't picture days without your glow♪

33
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:34,400
(Liqing, Xiuming's in the parking lot.)

34
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,080
Okay, I'm on my way.

35
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:37,780
♪Consumed♪

36
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:39,380
♪Under your spell♪

37
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:41,540
♪My power bends for you♪

38
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:43,940
♪No parallel♪

39
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:46,100
♪I break all rules for your♪

40
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:48,140
♪Rare pride♪

41
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,520
Parking lot now, Mr. Duan?

42
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:52,500
♪Lights up my side♪

43
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:56,680
♪I'm wrapped around you, deep inside♪

44
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,560
Quite a wild one.

45
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,900
♪Drowning in you, no way to hide♪

46
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:03,280
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

47
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,400
Don't think about escaping tonight.

48
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:10,060
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

49
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:14,140
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

50
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:15,430
=Quite The Girl=

51
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:15,950
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

52
00:03:15,950 --> 00:03:16,460
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

53
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,900
=Episode 28=

54
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:28,020
(Duan Liqing)

55
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,440
Mr. Duan.

56
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,360
(Mr. Lu, sorry to call so late.)

57
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:37,280
(About Miss Lu and
Duan Xiuming's marriage,)

58
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,520
(our family owes you an explanation.)

59
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,800
What do you mean?

60
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:42,920
(It's been long.)

61
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,520
(Time for them to settle it.)

62
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,400
(Meet tomorrow night?)

63
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,880
(We'll give you a proper answer.)

64
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:51,080
Okay. I'll be there.

65
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,280
Thank you for this.

66
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,120
Mingyu...

67
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,320
You'll return to the Lu family,

68
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,280
back to me.

69
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,640
Nervous about meeting my family?

70
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,720
I think you're the nervous one.

71
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:22,880
Liqing.

72
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,520
Where's your wife?

73
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,600
She got a call.

74
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,200
She'll be here in a while.

75
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,680
Let me introduce you. This is...

76
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,640
I know.

77
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,320
How do you know?

78
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,760
That day at the office,

79
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,280
you weren't exactly subtle.

80
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,800
If I couldn't even see that,

81
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,200
you can be the big brother.

82
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,040
Sit.

83
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,160
Marriage is a big deal.

84
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,720
You got married

85
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,040
in secret.

86
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,680
No family knows, no friends either.

87
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,840
Not a good look for either family.

88
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,520
Liqing.

89
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,120
This is my fault.

90
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,720
I was too rash.

91
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,080
But my feelings for Mingye are real.

92
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:04,840
Don't blame him.

93
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,960
He only did it to help me.

94
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,040
But here's the thing.

95
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,040
The men in our family have a tradition.

96
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,480
We listen to our wives.

97
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,640
My wife says that

98
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:17,040
after getting to know Mingye,

99
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,560
she found she's a great girl.

100
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:21,120
She says you two are a perfect match.

101
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,520
As his big brother,

102
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,720
I can't argue with that.

103
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,840
But I don't even know your wife.

104
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,120
Of course you do.

105
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:34,760
Mingye, we go way back.

106
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,160
Miss Xia...

107
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,960
I'm so sorry, Mingye.

108
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:43,880
For hiding it so long.

109
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,200
I did this

110
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,720
so you'd both see how you really feel.

111
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,840
And be happy together.

112
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:49,920
Don't worry.

113
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,720
If he ever bullies you,

114
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,760
I'll handle him.

115
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,880
Your acting is off the charts.

116
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,360
If not for that,

117
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,960
how'd I know you loved me so much?

118
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:06,720
Look.

119
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:07,600
So sweet.

120
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,280
Look at them now.

121
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,280
Even sweeter than when they started.

122
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,440
What?

123
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,120
You knew about me from the start?

124
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,960
Ever since he met you,

125
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,960
our phones have been blowing up.

126
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:23,520
He sends us candid shots
of you every day.

127
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,960
Of course we know you.

128
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,280
You sneaked photos of me?

129
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,600
That's not taking secret photos.

130
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,760
That's just documenting art.

131
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,160
Come on.

132
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,600
Check out your husband's
photography skills.

133
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,120
Not bad.

134
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,780
(Marry me)

135
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:18,380
♪The day we met the breeze felt sweet♪

136
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:25,740
♪You walked up smiling
like a movie scene♪

137
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:34,200
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

138
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,360
Lu Mingye.

139
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,960
You're special to me.

140
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,440
Meeting you,

141
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,160
falling for you...

142
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:47,240
is the one accident I'll never regret.

143
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,880
Our love story's backward, too.

144
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,360
We slept together first,

145
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,120
then got married.

146
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,520
But I still owe you one thing.

147
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,480
Will you marry me?

148
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,920
We're already married.

149
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,560
Other than saying yes,

150
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,200
what choice do I have?

151
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:17,540
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

152
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:24,460
♪I want to grow old with you♪

153
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:33,540
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

154
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:39,900
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

155
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,560
Other than marrying me,

156
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,560
you have no other choice.

157
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:53,440
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

158
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,600
So now you can admit

159
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,120
this was for me, right?

160
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,400
You even planned a secret proposal.

161
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,040
Nice job keeping it secret.

162
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,720
So that's how it is.

163
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,320
Lu Qiuliang

164
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,120
put Mingye through so much.

165
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,720
More than just that.

166
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,720
After hearing the details,

167
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,120
Lu Qiuliang is just

168
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,360
a twisted piece of garbage.

169
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,000
Using you to split Xiuming
and Mingye apart?

170
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,280
Not a chance.

171
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:22,560
In that case,

172
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:25,120
we can just play along

173
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,120
and put on a big show for him.

174
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:28,720
Liqing.

175
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:29,800
Lingshan.

176
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,120
I want to spend my life with Mingye.

177
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,440
Even though we're married,

178
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,440
I still want to propose properly.

179
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,800
- Agreed.
- Agreed.

180
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,760
Mingye's been through so much.

181
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,320
When she joins our family,

182
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,280
we'll treat her extra well.

183
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,040
Proposing is the basics.

184
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,040
Once back in Xiangjiang,

185
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,480
we'll throw them a proper wedding.

186
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,560
I got this.

187
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,160
Liqing, Lingshan.

188
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,200
As for the proposal,

189
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:00,680
I have an idea.

190
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,760
Mingye.

191
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,360
No one in our family has ever divorced.

192
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,920
Now that you've married Xiuming,

193
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,480
for the rest of your lives,

194
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:09,800
the place by his side

195
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:10,960
is yours alone.

196
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,040
Remember what he said.

197
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:21,300
♪I want to grow old with you♪

198
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,200
Mr. Lu.

199
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:27,680
Please, come in.

200
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,080
Mr. Duan.

201
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,760
You called me here,

202
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,040
saying you want to settle

203
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,400
your brother and Mingyu's marriage.

204
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,760
So what's the situation?

205
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,160
Mr. Lu, forgive me.

206
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,760
I wasn't clear on the phone.

207
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,040
We do need

208
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,400
to settle this.

209
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,640
These two

210
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,240
have been so reckless.

211
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:50,840
Something as big as marriage...

212
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,320
How could they

213
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,160
hide it from us?

214
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,320
Mingye's still young

215
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:57,440
and doesn't know better.

216
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,200
But Xiuming is even worse.

217
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,680
Marriage

218
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,840
can't be so rash.

219
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,960
So...

220
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,000
My wife and I have decided

221
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,200
that we'll give Mingye

222
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,600
a proper wedding.

223
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,720
Don't worry.

224
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,320
Once Mingye joins our family,

225
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,280
she's one of us.

226
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:25,320
We'll treat her like family

227
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,760
and never let her down.

228
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:29,000
When we're back in Xiangjiang,

229
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,080
we'll throw them a wedding.

230
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,760
You must be there for it.

231
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,440
As the officiant.

232
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,780
♪Silently plan to break the chain♪

233
00:11:39,780 --> 00:11:42,220
♪No one's shelter, no one's reliance♪

234
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:42,960
Uncle...

235
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:44,880
Thanks for all your trouble.

236
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,440
But don't worry.

237
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,520
My brother and sister-in-law are right.

238
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,280
Every ceremony

239
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,800
will be taken care of.

240
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:55,440
♪Wisdom sharp like blade unseen♪

241
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,240
Very well.

242
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,080
Then I'll leave it...

243
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,080
♪I hold my fate within my hand clean♪

244
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,920
to you.

245
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,080
Mr. Lu.

246
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,360
Join us for lunch.

247
00:12:03,380 --> 00:12:05,820
♪Power hidden underneath♪

248
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:06,920
I think I'll pass.

249
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:08,440
I have a meeting.

250
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:09,920
Maybe next time.

251
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:11,360
See you.

252
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:14,740
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

253
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,320
Let's eat.

254
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:18,720
Come on.

255
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,820
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

256
00:12:21,060 --> 00:12:24,300
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

257
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:27,500
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

258
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:30,780
♪My own salvation I believe♪

259
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:33,500
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

260
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:36,300
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

261
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:05,610
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

262
00:13:07,530 --> 00:13:11,630
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

263
00:13:14,530 --> 00:13:19,310
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

264
00:13:20,250 --> 00:13:26,130
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

265
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:33,760
♪A love letter written in song♪

266
00:13:34,590 --> 00:13:40,080
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

267
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:48,230
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

268
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:55,130
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

269
00:13:55,130 --> 00:14:02,120
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

270
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:05,340
♪Close your eyes and count♪

271
00:14:05,340 --> 00:14:12,050
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

272
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:14,350
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
